<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge edges down to 75.7000 per dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge edges down to 75.7000 per dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.7000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 75.6900 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     May 15		  May 14</p>
<p> High			     75.7000		 75.7000</p>
<p> Low				75.6990		 75.4400</p>
<p> Open			     75.7000		 75.4400</p>
<p> Close			    75.7000		 75.6900</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  9.495		   4.185</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
